 ci-logs/
 
-# Local installation of locked CI tooling
-**/node_modules/
+# Investigation evidence committed on purpose: the CI logs, GitHub API dumps and
+# analysis for an issue live under dev/log/issues/<issue>/pulls/<pr>/ and must
+# survive the generic "logs", "*.log" and "ci-logs/" rules above.
+!dev/log/**
